acceptance_criteria: "The unknown-command refusal leads with the did-you-mean candidate and names pm --help --all or pm guide capabilities, never the curated listing alone; tests is a permanent alias of test in PM_COMMAND_ALIAS_CONTRACTS and completion, contracts, and MCP names regenerate from the alias table; A negative control that seeds a hint naming only the curated listing fails the refusal-closure gate; GH-1169 is closed with the shipped release named in its tracker-link comment"
